      "text": "argparse:",
      "fontSize": 36,
      "fontFamily": 7,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "argparse:",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.15
    },
    {
      "id": "sGaLSCYriNTaogxcjoP9t",
      "type": "text",
      "x": -355.3629453548365,
      "y": -705.7405133928572,
      "width": 343.9486067338422,
      "height": 364.0110359258489,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [
        "DPMSaFxJfzyQvDjnKWKsd"
      ],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "a2O",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 812718472,
      "version": 897,
      "versionNonce": 773892475,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [
        {
          "id": "UtQ0dlvvRhAmX-gVCJDiq",
          "type": "arrow"
        }
      ],
      "updated": 1795546955703,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "the exact decision order argparse runs through\nwhen naming an attribute:\n\n    Explicit dest= →→ Overrides everything\n(dest=\"my_var\" →→ args.my_var).\n\n    Positional argument →→ Uses the name directly\n(\"filename\" →→ args.filename).\n\n    First -- (double-dash) flag →→ Strips leading\n-- and replaces internal - with _ (\"--max-count\"\n→→ args.max_count).\n\n    First - (single-dash) flag →→ Fallback only\nif no -- flag exists; strips - and replaces\ninternal - with _ (\"-v\" →→ args.v).\n\nOnce argparse resolves that name at registration\ntime (.add_argument()), that attribute is\nguaranteed to exist on the Namespace object\nreturned by .parse_args()—even if the user didn't\npass that flag in the terminal (in which case it\nholds its default, or None).",
      "fontSize": 12.661253423507787,
      "fontFamily": 8,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "the exact decision order argparse runs through when naming an attribute:\n\n    Explicit dest= →→ Overrides everything (dest=\"my_var\" →→ args.my_var).\n\n    Positional argument →→ Uses the name directly (\"filename\" →→ args.filename).\n\n    First -- (double-dash) flag →→ Strips leading -- and replaces internal - with _ (\"--max-count\" →→ args.max_count).\n\n    First - (single-dash) flag →→ Fallback only if no -- flag exists; strips - and replaces internal - with _ (\"-v\" →→ args.v).\n\nOnce argparse resolves that name at registration time (.add_argument()), that attribute is guaranteed to exist on the Namespace object returned by .parse_args()—even if the user didn't pass that flag in the terminal (in which case it holds its default, or None).",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
