      "updated": 1795546955703,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "argparse handles the errors automatically when calling parse.parse_args(). It automatically converts the given\nargument with the specified type. When it incounters an error, it makes a simple super friendly message telling\nthe user the error acquired after catching it followed by a controlled exit (sys.exit(2))/",
      "fontSize": 12.81288186530886,
      "fontFamily": 8,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "argparse handles the errors automatically when calling parse.parse_args(). It automatically converts the given argument with the specified type. When it incounters an error, it makes a simple super friendly message telling the user the error acquired after catching it followed by a controlled exit (sys.exit(2))/",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "f34bZH4Gj3Yt-mTCv6js-",
