      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1795546940488,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "The function name tells you the direction (load = in, dump = out) and the format (s = string, no s = file object):\n\n\njson.load(f)                JSON → Python             File             Reads an open file into a Python dict or list.\njson.dump(data, f)          Python → JSON             File             Writes Python data into an open file as JSON.\njson.loads(str)             JSON → Python             String           Parses a JSON string into a Python dict or list.\njson.dumps(data)            Python → JSON             String           Converts Python data into a JSON-formatted string.",
      "fontSize": 11.752706786141035,
      "fontFamily": 8,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "The function name tells you the direction (load = in, dump = out) and the format (s = string, no s = file object):\n\n\njson.load(f)                JSON → Python             File             Reads an open file into a Python dict or list.\njson.dump(data, f)          Python → JSON             File             Writes Python data into an open file as JSON.\njson.loads(str)             JSON → Python             String           Parses a JSON string into a Python dict or list.\njson.dumps(data)            Python → JSON             String           Converts Python data into a JSON-formatted string.",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
